    "q-114129": {
      "dom_id": "step-q114129",
      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133186/assets/a493b0c356b7088479ec6c80afff94eb5e39fd8b31d14b771076b9a9ab37ddc1.png)\n\nIn the figure above, $m∠AOD={170}^{∘}$ and $m∠BOD={130}^{∘}.$ Find $m∠AOC.$",
      "worked_solution": "The measure of $∠AOB$ must be the *difference* between the large angle $(∠AOD)$ and the smaller known angle $(∠BOD).$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nm∠AOB={170}^{∘}-{130}^{∘}={40}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nLet's add this to our diagram:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133186/assets/12431bb2f66402469571c49ac5637376f89e54265748fa88b3a6450c14bd7bce.png)\n\n  \n\nWe can now find the measure of $∠AOC:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠AOC & =m∠AOB+m∠BOC \\\\  & ={40}^{∘}+{65}^{∘} \\\\  & ={105}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-114129-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{110}^{∘}",
              "html": " <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"166\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>110</mn></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-114129-b",
